{"title": "9/16(三) 例行維護公告 (已結束)", "createDate": 1789467480, "content": "<p> <style>* { font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif !important; }</style></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">冒險家您好。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">為提供更加穩定的遊戲服務環境，我們將於下列時間進行例行維護作業。&nbsp;<br>    維護期間將無法登入遊戲，敬請冒險家提前做好準備。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>◼ 維護時間</strong>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 2026年9月16日(三) 上午6時 ～ <s>上午8時30分</s>&nbsp; <strong><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\">上午9時</span></strong></span></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\">* 因作業內容超乎預期需延長維護，敬請見諒！</span></span></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>◼ 維護內容&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 新增「白魅魔」團隊副本及相關內容。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 新增深淵「地獄4」難度。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 修正部分行動裝置遊玩「南部廢墟」地下城時，於特定圖形設定下畫面異常顯示並卡頓的問題。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 調整部分裝置的圖形設定項目，以改善可能發生的遊戲問題。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 新增「月光豐收節」、「庫漢煙火 On-Time！」等活動。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 其他詳細內容請見「9/16(三) 更新日誌」。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">* 「白魅魔」團隊副本預計於9/21(一)上午6時開放。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">* 深淵「地獄4」難度預計於9/28(一)上午6時開放。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>◼ 以下已知問題預計於本次維護進行修正&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">-「皇家交響套組選擇包(包含時裝)」無法販售的現象。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 夜市食物選擇箱內容物變更的現象。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 嘗試進行傳說寵物技能變更時，出現空白視窗的現象。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 9/9(三)維護前獲得的好友邀請特別禮物箱，維護後開啟內容物與原先不同的現象。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">* 夜市食物選擇箱修正前已獲得的錯誤道具「軟綿綿起司喵蛋糕」、「芬芳飄香摩卡喵蛋糕」、「酥脆餅乾喵蛋糕」、「甜蜜濕潤巧克力喵蛋糕」預計進行回收，並補發「夜市食物選擇箱」。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">* 已取得好友邀請特別禮物箱異常內容物「強化再燃燒催化劑」與「增幅解除藥水」的玩家，如希望改領原有獎勵，請透過客服管道提出申請。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 商城內部份商品的說明未包含獲得方法的現象。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 輕盈舞步動作&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;舞會樂器選擇箱&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 燃燒寶石支援套組&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 清新成長特別套組&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 清新催化劑套組&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 清新刻印強化套組&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 萬眾矚目動作箱&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 美味動作箱&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 每週魔族貢品箱&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 符文碎片1,000個&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 皇家交響全套套組&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 鹿的馬鞍箱&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>◼ 結束活動與商品提醒&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 以下商品將於2026年9月16日(三)上午5時59分維護前結束販售，請把握最後購買機會。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">商城商品下架&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><a href=\"https://tw.nexon.com/mabinogimobile/home/news/notice/3531554\" target=\"_blank\">甜蜜微風挑戰套組</a>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><a href=\"https://tw.nexon.com/mabinogimobile/home/news/notice/3531554\" target=\"_blank\">迎夏遊玩支援套組</a>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><a href=\"https://tw.nexon.com/mabinogimobile/home/news/notice/3531554\" target=\"_blank\">迎夏魔族貢品套組</a>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>◼ 維護補償&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 為感謝冒險家於維護期間的耐心等候，我們將發送以下補償獎勵：&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"table-layout:auto; border-collapse:collapse; border:none\"> <tbody>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; background-color:#262626; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:white\">補償道具</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; background-color:#262626; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:white\">數量</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">精靈之翼</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">15</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">0</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">小銀幣箱</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">10</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">金幣</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">5</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">0,000</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">解除詛咒藥水</span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">2</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">堤爾克那高級料理選擇箱</span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">2</span></span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr> </tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"table-layout:auto; border-collapse:collapse; border:none\"> <tbody>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; background-color:#262626; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">延長維護補償道具</span></b></span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; background-color:#262626; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">數量</span></b></span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">移動速度秘藥</span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">2</span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">傷害減少秘藥</span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">2</span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">不死粉末</span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1</span></p></td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:416px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">小銀幣箱</span></span></span></span></p></td>   <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:113px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">    <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"line-height:2em\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:微軟正黑體,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif\">10</span></span></span></span></p></td>  </tr> </tbody></table><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">* 維護補償可於2026/9/17(四) 23:59前領取，請於期限內登入遊戲並 領取補償。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">* 道具保管期限可於遊戲內信箱確認。（信件到期時間：2026/9/19(六) 23:59）&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">* 透過信箱發放的限時道具，其有效期限將自信件發放時開始計算，請務必於期限內領取並使用。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 小銀幣箱的注意事項&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">* 使用時，獲得銀幣1個&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">* 使用期限至2026/9/21(一) 23:59&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>✔ 注意事項</strong>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 維護期間若信件超過保存期限，該信件可能會被系統自動刪除。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 維護期間將無法登入或使用遊戲相關服務。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 維護時間可能依實際作業情況提前結束或延長，若有異動將透過本公告另行說明。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 請冒險家於維護開始前提前完成遊戲內相關操作，以避免資料異常或遊戲進度受到影響。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 若維護結束後資料更新未正常完成，可能會影響遊戲正常登入。請先完全關閉手機 App 或 PC 版本用戶端後，再重新登入遊戲。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 維護期間，PC 與手機版皆無法登入遊戲。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 維護期間，優惠碼兌換頁面可能無法正常使用。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">- 我們將持續努力提供更穩定的服務環境，造成不便敬請見諒。感謝各位冒險家的理解與支持。&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">《瑪奇 Mobile》營運團隊敬上</span></span></p>"}